Release Notes

*Insites Components* `v3.3.5` — pinned at `v3/3.3.5` (TW#26896897)

Admin screens sometimes rendered without tables, editors or file inputs ("Constructor for ins-table#undefined was not found") when one component download failed, and a refresh often did not fix it.

- A component whose code fails to download now retries in the page three times (after 0.4 s, 1.5 s and 4 s) at `<chunk>.entry.js?retry=<n>`, before Stencil gives up. CRM's reload guard only sees the last failure. `scripts/stencil-lazy-retry.js` patches Stencil's loader on every build and test run, and fails the build if a Stencil upgrade changes the code it patches.
- `publish.sh` serves hashed `p-*.js` chunks as `max-age=31536000, immutable`, so browsers stop re-checking 90 files every five minutes. Loaders stay at five minutes.
- `promote.sh` no longer deletes old chunks from `v3/latest`, so a loader cached just before a promote still finds its own chunks.
- `scripts/cdn-cache-settings.sh` (run once): a `/v3/*` CloudFront behaviour that keys on the query string, so a retry reaches a fresh copy, and no edge caching of 403/404/5xx responses.

*Rollback*: re-pin CRM to `v3/3.3.4`.

